==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*1 [[Capy]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Capy]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Capy]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
By using [[Crazy Hearts (Combo)|Crazy Hearts]] and rusher units like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] with Explosion [[Talents]], [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], this stage can be easily rushed down before the Fallen Bear spawns. Just remember to use [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Mohawk Cat]] and [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]] to protect him from the other enemies, which can very easily one shot him. Spawn your other units as needed to destroy the base before the Fallen Bear spawns.

Alternatively, a mix 2-3 meatshields ([[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Gato Amigo]] with Surge Immune is recommend to prevent Capy from hitting your important units after death surges), anti-Red units, a unit with Shield Piercing and units that can outrange Fallen Bear such as [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Evil Aku Researcher]] will eventually clear this stage.

